	<property id="FlashBankModeText">
		<target>TMS320C29XX</target>
		<name> Set the Flash Bank Mode Settings before load operations for CPU1.
Note: Bank Mode Flash Address Mapping

Bank Mode 0
----------------
FRI-1(CPU1 program): Address Range (0x10000000 - 0x100FFFFF), Flash Banks (FLC1.B0/B1)
FRI-1(CPU1 program): Address Range (0x10100000 - 0x101FFFFF), Flash Banks (FLC1.B2/B3)
FRI-1(CPU1 program): Address Range (0x10200000 - 0x102FFFFF), Flash Banks (FLC2.B0/B1)
FRI-1(CPU1 program): Address Range (0x10300000 - 0x103FFFFF), Flash Banks (FLC2.B2/B3)
FRI-4(CPU1 program): Address Range (0x10C00000 - 0x10C3FFFF), Flash Bank  (FLC1.B4)

Bank Mode 1
----------------
FRI-1(CPU1 program): Address Range (0x10000000 - 0x100FFFFF), Flash Banks (FLC1.B0/B1)
FRI-1(CPU1 program): Address Range (0x10100000 - 0x101FFFFF), Flash Banks (FLC2.B0/B1)
FRI-3(FOTA program): Address Range (0x10600000 - 0x106FFFFF), Flash Banks (FLC1.B2/B3)
FRI-3(FOTA program): Address Range (0x10700000 - 0x107FFFFF), Flash Banks (FLC2.B2/B3)
FRI-4(CPU1 program): Address Range (0x10C00000 - 0x10C3FFFF), Flash Bank  (FLC1.B4)

		</name>
		<valueType>Text</valueType>
	</property>

